      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers offer high praise for veterinarians, technicians, and front desk personnel at this Lincoln Park clinic. Pet owners appreciate doctors like Dr. Smith and Dr. Katz for their attentive demeanor, thorough physical examinations, and long-term continuity of care. Although one client reported an unpleasant dispute with management, the vast majority describe a supportive experience."
