        "en": "Calming approach during visits"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the team's ability to keep anxious pets comfortable throughout checkups and minor procedures. Reviewers note that staff pay close attention to animal body language, reducing stress for reactive dogs and nervous rescue cats. Pet parents value knowing their companions are treated with genuine affection."
      }
    },
    {
