      "title": {
        "en": "Proactive follow-ups with isolated issues"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication generally receives positive remarks, with owners commending timely text updates and prompt phone follow-ups regarding test results. Doctors proactively check in on recovering pets. However, one owner experienced serious frustration after receiving no surgical updates over an extended waiting period."
      }
    }
